  data: {
    LLM: '1. Turn up a card from the Stock.\n2. If it can be played on a Foundation, do so.\n3. If not, you MUST place it on one of the 4 Waste piles.\n4. You can only move the TOP card of a Waste pile to a Foundation. You cannot move cards between Waste piles.',
    Player: '1. Turn up a card from the Stock.\n2. If it can be played on a Foundation, do so.\n3. If not, you MUST place it on one of the 4 Waste piles.\n4. You can only move the TOP card of a Waste pile to a Foundation. You cannot move cards between Waste piles.',
    objective: 'Move all 52 cards onto the four foundation piles by building each foundation in its fixed interval sequence (Ace+1, 2+2, 3+3, 4+4) until every card is played; the game is lost if no further play is possible.',
    gameplay: '1. Turn up a card from the Stock.\n2. If it can be played on a Foundation, do so.\n3. If not, you MUST place it on one of the 4 Waste piles.\n4. You can only move the TOP card of a Waste pile to a Foundation. You cannot move cards between Waste piles.',
